        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith Auctioneers are delighted to bring this 4 Bedroom End Of Terrace House to the market. The property is located in a much sought-after area, within walking distance of Boyle Town Centre and all its amenities such as schools, churches, medical centre, railway station and only a short drive to Lough Key Forest & Activity Park. Accommodation includes: Kitchen/Dining room, Utility Room, Sun Room, Living Room, Downstairs wc, 4 Bedrooms (Master Bedroom with en suite) & Main Bathroom.\r\n\r\nThis is an ideal opportunity for a great family home or good investment property.\r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended & by appointment only\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\r\nFully fitted kitchen with timber floor\r\n\r\nUtility Room \r\nFully fitted & Plumbed\r\n\r\nSun Room\r\nWith timber floor and double doors to outside\r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\nWith timber floor and Feature Fireplace\r\n\r\nDownstairs W.C \r\nFully tiled with w.c. and w.h.b.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom with en-suite \r\nWith timber floor, built in wardrobes and fully fitted en suite.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 \r\nWith timber floor and built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \r\nWith timber floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 \r\nWith timber floor\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom \r\nFully tiled with w.h.b., w.c., bath & electric shower\r\n\r\nExternal\r\nOff Street Parking at Front\r\nLean To Shed\r\nDecking Area\r\nTarmac Yard\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAll Mains Services\r\nOil Fired Central Heating"
      },
